---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'; import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro'; import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Start a Project | GameCore Labs" description="Tell GameCore Labs about your game, prototype, gameplay programming or Unity support needs.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="GET IN TOUCH" title="Let's Build Something Great." description="Have a game idea or an existing project that needs development support? Tell us about it and we'll see how we can help." compact/>
  <section class="section-tight"><div class="container contact-grid"><ContactForm/><aside><p class="eyebrow">OTHER WAYS TO REACH US</p><h2>Start with what you know.</h2><p>You do not need a perfect specification. A short summary, current build status and the result you want are enough to begin.</p><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a><dl><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Hanoi, Vietnam (GMT+7)</dd></div><div><dt>Availability</dt><dd>Remote collaboration worldwide</dd></div></dl><div class="brief card"><span>01</span><p><b>Idea or problem</b><br/>What are you trying to build or improve?</p><span>02</span><p><b>Current stage</b><br/>Concept, prototype or active production?</p><span>03</span><p><b>Useful context</b><br/>Target platform, timeline and priorities.</p></div></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);align-items:start}aside{padding-top:.4rem}aside h2{margin:.3rem 0;font-size:1.7rem}aside>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#9ca8b8}aside>a{display:inline-block;margin:.6rem 0 1.5rem;color:#bdcaff;font-weight:650}dl{display:grid;gap:.9rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}dt{color:#707d8f;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}dd{margin:.1rem 0 0;color:#d6dee9;font-size:.9rem}.brief{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.9rem;padding:1.2rem}.brief span{color:#8f7cff;font-weight:800;font-size:.75rem}.brief p{margin:0;color:#9ca8b8;font-size:.84rem}.brief b{color:#e7ebf2}@media(max-width:850px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
